                                                "sense_id": "ef862cc1-80b8-3a3a-88fa-d06d2de51845",
                                                "text": "DHPG […] is effective in fighting Cytomegalovirus (CMV), a common virus which, for PWAs, can cause CMV retinitis — a condition which can lead to blindness within weeks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "db147c53-b8d9-3f8d-95ac-11313de6edc6",
                                        "entry_id": "26cf36e4-9b7f-393d-8cc7-278cfb735065",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Want of intellectual or moral discernment; mental darkness; ignorance, heedlessness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
